〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
